    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong><br>Abyss of Death is an action game in which you are an American soldier sent on a mission to Vietnam. However, nothing can be easy.<br>On your way to the base your helicopter was shot down. Wake up in the middle of the jungle with only one aim, survive in the enemy territory.<br>Thanks to the split screen you can  experience the adventure alone or with a friend !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>EXPLORE !</strong><br>During gameplay you will encounter different sceneries like :  jungle, villages, underground tunnels and cities.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong><br>Almost everythink can be destroyed due to advance destruction system implemented inside the game !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/da44f31977deb879de9720a2245c1183.avif?t=1598362767\" /></div><br><strong>GOOD GUN IS YOUR BEST FRIEND !</strong><br>At various stages of game you will have an opportunity to use a wide variety of rifles, machine guns, grenades and heavy weapons like RPG or flame thrower.<br>Every weapon is different so choose wisely !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/6e2f59c6561165e7240ecca54f74ec03.avif?t=1598362767\" /></div><br><strong>STAY IN TOUCH !</strong><br>If you want to be informed about new games or future updates follow &quot; Vainture Studio&quot; on social medias !",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/746fe17f43b04e283ec9635231efb5a5.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong><br>Abyss of Death is an action game in which you are an American soldier sent on a mission to Vietnam. However, nothing can be easy.<br>On your way to the base your helicopter was shot down. Wake up in the middle of the jungle with only one aim, survive in the enemy territory.<br>Thanks to the split screen you can  experience the adventure alone or with a friend !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/e58070a7e1d14728de89e275788e46b4.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>EXPLORE !</strong><br>During gameplay you will encounter different sceneries like :  jungle, villages, underground tunnels and cities.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.poster.avif?t=1598362767\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.webm?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/433d9c28f5ce7704eb6ad73ff077c428.mp4?t=1598362767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong><br>Almost everythink can be destroyed due to advance destruction system implemented inside the game !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/da44f31977deb879de9720a2245c1183.avif?t=1598362767\" /></div><br><strong>GOOD GUN IS YOUR BEST FRIEND !</strong><br>At various stages of game you will have an opportunity to use a wide variety of rifles, machine guns, grenades and heavy weapons like RPG or flame thrower.<br>Every weapon is different so choose wisely !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354000/extras/6e2f59c6561165e7240ecca54f74ec03.avif?t=1598362767\" /></div><br><strong>STAY IN TOUCH !</strong><br>If you want to be informed about new games or future updates follow &quot; Vainture Studio&quot; on social medias !",
